Hallucination Detection Casebook

A research repository documenting hallucination patterns and reasoning failures in Large Language Models.


Overview

This project focuses on identifying, analyzing, and categorizing hallucinations generated by AI systems.

The repository contains:

- Fabricated citations
- False factual claims
- Logical inconsistencies
- Unsupported assumptions
- Confidence calibration failures

Objectives

- Study hallucination patterns
- Improve AI reliability
- Develop detection strategies
- Analyze root causes
- Build mitigation frameworks


